        "description": "ST EduCare Landing Page is a clean, minimal, and free WordPress theme expertly crafted for academies, colleges, online institutions, coaching and training centres. A beautiful, fast, lightweight, responsive, easy-to-customize theme, the EduCare Landing Page features a dynamic conversion optimization hero section, a course catalogue, an instructor section and student testimonials. It's SEO friendliness and quick loading speed make your site rank easier on Google and other search engines. The theme options panel is too easy to use, and it is fully responsive to all devices, such as smartphones, tablets, etc. We have extensive documentation and a friendly support team on hand if you need help with using our theme. As well as seamless integration with Elementor, it provides a smooth, enjoyable design experience. Why Wait? Download the ST EduCare Landing Page today and start creating an educational website that truly stands out!.. Theme Demo Page: https://striviothemes.com/demo/st-educare-pro/"
